OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHealthcare workers at 'tipping
OL,4,Apoint' as union ballots for industrial
OL,5,Aaction
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe union has been demanding this
OL,8,Fyear's pay award to be implemented
OL,9,Fimmediately, alongside pay reform
OL,10,Fparity with other regions in the UK and
OL,11,Fthe extension of the Real Living Wage
OL,12,Fto those in the care sector.
OL,14,FThe Department of Health said
OL,15,Fimplementing the 2026-27 pay award and
OL,16,FReal Living Wage would cost about
OL,17,F#280m.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
